<h3>Dramatis Personæ</h3>
<p class="drama">
RUMOUR, the Presenter.<br>
KING HENRY the Fourth.<br>
HENRY, PRINCE OF WALES, afterwards King Henry the Fifth.<br>
THOMAS, DUKE OF CLARENCE.<br>
PRINCE JOHN OF LANCASTER.<br>
PRINCE HUMPHREY OF GLOUCESTER.<br>
EARL OF WARWICK.<br>
EARL OF WESTMORELAND.<br>
EARL OF SURREY.<br>
GOWER.<br>
HARCOURT.<br>
SIR JOHN BLUNT.<br>
Lord CHIEF JUSTICE of the King’s Bench.<br>
A SERVANT of the Chief Justice.<br>
Henry Percy, Earl of NORTHUMBERLAND.<br>
Scroop, ARCHBISHOP of York.<br>
Lord MOWBRAY.<br>
Lord HASTINGS.<br>
LORD BARDOLPH.<br>
SIR JOHN COLEVILLE.<br>
TRAVERS and MORTON, retainers of Northumberland.<br>
SIR JOHN FALSTAFF.<br>
His Page.<br>
BARDOLPH.<br>
PISTOL.<br>
POINS.<br>
PETO.<br>
SHALLOW and SILENCE, country justices.<br>
DAVY, Servant to Shallow.<br>
MOULDY, SHADOW, WART, FEEBLE, and BULLCALF, recruits.<br>
FANG and SNARE, sheriff’s officers.
</p>
<p class="noindent">
LADY NORTHUMBERLAND.<br>
LADY PERCY.<br>
