</p>
<p>  QUEEN KATHARINE, wife to King Henry, afterwards divorced<br>
  ANNE BULLEN, her Maid of Honour, afterwards Queen<br>
  AN OLD LADY, friend to Anne Bullen<br>
  PATIENCE, woman to Queen Katharine<br>
