<h4>Dramatis Personæ</h4>
<p>
THESEUS, Duke of Athens<br>
HIPPOLYTA, Queen of the Amazons, bethrothed to Theseus<br>
EGEUS, Father to Hermia<br>
HERMIA, daughter to Egeus, in love with Lysander<br>
HELENA, in love with Demetrius<br>
LYSANDER, in love with Hermia<br>
DEMETRIUS, in love with Hermia<br>
PHILOSTRATE, Master of the Revels to Theseus<br>
<br>
QUINCE, the Carpenter<br>
SNUG, the Joiner<br>
BOTTOM, the Weaver<br>
