CLOWN, his son<br>
AUTOLYCUS, a rogue<br>
A Mariner<br>
A Gaoler<br>
Servant to the Old Shepherd<br>
Other Sicilian Lords<br>
Sicilian Gentlemen<br>
Officers of a Court of Judicature
</p>
